title: "Offer-to-Exit: Pricing a Home Under Uncertainty"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Monk
    given-names: Thomas Preston
version: 0.2.0
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A reproducible housing-pricing research prototype that combines a Tampa and
  Orlando transaction study with a location-neutral controlled experiment for
  linked acquisition and resale decisions under uncertainty.
keywords:
  - housing economics
  - pricing
  - repeat sales
  - survival analysis
  - uncertainty quantification
  - dynamic programming
  - causal simulation
